\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.1}{\ignorespaces Overview of the two-module training-free FSCIL backbone studied in this thesis. Module~1 performs tri-level modality calibration (textual intra-modal, visual inter-model, and inter-modal calibration); Module~2 performs query prototype rectification, refining only novel DINOv2 prototypes through a precision-favoring gate. The Discriminative Prompt-based Recalibration module proposed in \autoref {sec:dpr} operates upstream of Module~1's textual intra-modal calibration and is not shown here, since it introduces no new images or query-side evidence, only an additional label-only refinement of the semantic prototype pipeline already depicted.}}{13}{figure.caption.6}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:architecture}{{3.1}{13}{Overview of the two-module training-free FSCIL backbone studied in this thesis. Module~1 performs tri-level modality calibration (textual intra-modal, visual inter-model, and inter-modal calibration); Module~2 performs query prototype rectification, refining only novel DINOv2 prototypes through a precision-favoring gate. The Discriminative Prompt-based Recalibration module proposed in \autoref {sec:dpr} operates upstream of Module~1's textual intra-modal calibration and is not shown here, since it introduces no new images or query-side evidence, only an additional label-only refinement of the semantic prototype pipeline already depicted}{figure.caption.6}{}}
