\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5.2}{\ignorespaces Per-query behavior of \textsc  {TRiC}'s inter-modal calibration at base and final sessions. Each stacked bar decomposes correct predictions by how the semantic and calibrated-visual branches voted: all correct (both branches agree and are right), visual recovery (semantic wrong, visual right, \textsc  {TRiC} right), semantic recovery (visual wrong, semantic right, \textsc  {TRiC} right), and \textsc  {TRiC} alone (only the fused decision is right).}}{30}{figure.caption.14}\protected@file@percent }
